@inject PvSystemInfo Site

@*
    The browser tab, for someone with two of these open (issue #111). "Dashboard — Gleanvolt" says
    which product; "Dashboard — Jinacovice" says which roof, which is the question a second tab
    creates. The product name is already on every page, in the header.

    A component rather than a line per page so that the pattern is decided once: eight pages spelling
    out their own suffix is eight chances for one of them to drift.
*@

<PageTitle>@Page — @(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Site.Name) ? "Gleanvolt" : Site.Name)</PageTitle>

@code {
    /// <summary>What this page is, in the two or three words that fit in a tab.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    [EditorRequired]
    public required string Page { get; set; }
}
